    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRUTAL First Person Shooter focused on action, gore, and exploration. Fueled by adrenaline-pumping trap-metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismember hordes of evil monsters, find secrets, master bunny hopping, and tear enemies apart with powerful guns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast movement with bunny hopping, lots of blood </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-pumping trap-metal soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies: from Shadowclaws to 5 headed Hydras, all want to see you gutted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different levels, on each level you will find new guns, secrets and encounter new gameplay situations, providing around 4+ hours of action packed experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 guns at your disposal, each one can be enhanced by exploring levels and finding enhanced ammo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 3 unique bosses in a challenging fights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple environments but enhanced by Unreal Engine 5's Lumen software ray tracing providing great lighting! Combined with optimizations and shader precompilation ensuring stutter-free experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a game inspired by classic shooters like Painkiller, Serious Sam and DOOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy non-stop action and gameplay without interruptions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game made by one person - may contain bugs and other issues.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRUTAL First Person Shooter focused on action, gore, and exploration. Fueled by adrenaline-pumping trap-metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismember hordes of evil monsters, find secrets, master bunny hopping, and tear enemies apart with powerful guns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast movement with bunny hopping, lots of blood </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-pumping trap-metal soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies: from Shadowclaws to 5 headed Hydras, all want to see you gutted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different levels, on each level you will find new guns, secrets and encounter new gameplay situations, providing around 4+ hours of action packed experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 guns at your disposal, each one can be enhanced by exploring levels and finding enhanced ammo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 3 unique bosses in a challenging fights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple environments but enhanced by Unreal Engine 5's Lumen software ray tracing providing great lighting! Combined with optimizations and shader precompilation ensuring stutter-free experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a game inspired by classic shooters like Painkiller, Serious Sam and DOOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy non-stop action and gameplay without interruptions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game made by one person - may contain bugs and other issues.</h2>",
